  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Judiciary Reforms</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Judiciary Reforms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I denna promemoria f&#xF6;resl&#xE5;s att Sida forts&#xE4;tter st&#xF6;dja refom av r&#xE4;ttsv&#xE4;sendet i Kenya genom samarbete i en andra fas mellan det kenyanska r&#xE4;ttsv&#xE4;sendet (Judiciary), tyska GIZ och Sverige (Sida) med programtiteln &quot;St&#xF6;d till det kenyanska r&#xE4;ttsv&#xE4;sendet inom omr&#xE5;dena Transformering, Integritet och Ansvarsutr&#xE4;vande/Ansvarstagande&quot;.

Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r den f&#xF6;reslagna insatsen &#xE4;r att &quot;bibeh&#xE5;lla och f&#xF6;rdjupa transformeringen av r&#xE4;ttsv&#xE4;sendet genom strukturer f&#xF6;r ansvarsutkr&#xE4;vande/ansvarstagande f&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ka tillg&#xE5;ngen till r&#xE4;ttsv&#xE4;sendet f&#xF6;r befolkningen. Det f&#xF6;resl&#xE5;s att 26 miljoner mkr allokeras f&#xF6;r reformprogrammet under perioden 15 november 2014 - 31 december 2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this appraisal it is proposed that Sweden continues to support judiciary reform in Kenya through a collaboration programme between the Judiciary, Germany (GIZ)  and Sweden (Sida) under the name of &quot;Support to the Kenyan Judiciary in the Areas of Transformation, Integrity and Accountability&quot;. The overall objective for the proposed programme is to &quot;sustain and deepen the transformation of the Judiciary through accountable structures to enhance access to and delivery of justice&quot;. It is proposed that 26 million SEK shall be allocated to the reform programme during the period 15 November 2014 - 31 December 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
